Package: CAULDRON
Title: Single-Cell and Single-Nuclei RNA-seq Analysis Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yohan", "Lefol", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "email@example.com")
Description: Modular pipeline for single-cell and single-nuclei RNA-seq analysis
    including quality control, preprocessing, dimensionality reduction, clustering,
    annotation, differential expression, trajectory analysis, cell-cell
    communication, and visualization. Built on SingleCellExperiment (Bioconductor).
    Named after figures from Norse mythology.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
